Fixes the macOS native E2E startup race observed in CI run 32684794031. The child-session read-only test now waits only for the Tauri IPC bridge to exist before invoking e2e_verify_child_chat_stream_read_only exactly once; the mutating command itself is never retried. Evidence: previous green run delayed worker readiness about 9s, failed run started after about 3.5s and failed in 140ms while the subsequent native journey passed. Validation: node contract test green, tsc green, lint green, full local npm run test:e2e green, and the exact macOS CEF journey passed twice locally. One separate repeated-run CEF capability timeout was observed once and did not recur; no process remained.
